    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾱμώματα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δημοσίᾳ ᾀδόμενα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				797
			</span></i>, from Stes.(<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				37
			</span></i>): expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινώματα, δημοσιώματα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμώμενος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαλλόμενος, οἱ δὲ παίζων,</span> Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμώσεις:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημόται, ἢ οἱ ἐντελεῖς</span> (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμώσικτον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδοκιμασμένον</span> (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾶν</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾶ.</span>
			</div>
